eyRequestOptions"},{"type":"text","text":"; the SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t build or present any passkey UI. A passkey both identifies and verifies the user. Only discoverable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passkeys are supported."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On success, exchanges the returned authorization code for "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auth0.Auth0\/documentation\/Auth0\/Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" internally and returns them directly."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a second factor is also required, the request instead fails with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auth0.Auth0\/documentation\/Auth0\/EmbeddedAuthErrorReason\/insufficientAuthorization(reason:nextActions:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and the MFA actions in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nextActions"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the passkey couldn’t be verified, the request fails with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auth0.Auth0\/documentation\/Auth0\/EmbeddedAuthErrorReason\/InsufficientAuthorization\/invalidPasskey"},{"type":"text","text":". Show the passkey UI again with the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"options found in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nextActions"},{"type":"text","text":" (the previous assertion can’t be reused), or offer another option. The server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"might not offer the passkey again, so look for "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.auth0.Auth0\/documentation\/Auth0\/NextAction\/verifyPasskey(options:requestJson:)"},{"type":"text","text":" before showing the UI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the assertion h